### VS Code REST Client file.  Install the "REST Client" extension, set the two
### variables below from your Supabase project, then click "Send Request".
@baseUrl = https://YOUR-PROJECT-ref.supabase.co/rest/v1/rpc
@apikey  = YOUR-ANON-KEY

### 1. Get current booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/get_booking
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_ref": "ABC123" }

### 2. Search flights (SIN -> NRT, 8 Oct)
POST {{baseUrl}}/search_flights
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_origin": "SIN", "p_destination": "NRT", "p_date": "2026-10-08", "p_ref": "ABC123" }

### 3. Change flight to NS1156
POST {{baseUrl}}/change_flight
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_ref": "ABC123", "p_new_flight_number": "NS1156" }

### 4. Seat map for NS1156
POST {{baseUrl}}/get_seat_map
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_flight_number": "NS1156" }

### 5. Change seat to 6A
POST {{baseUrl}}/change_seat
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_ref": "ABC123", "p_new_seat_number": "6A" }

### 6. Add an extra bag (2 total)
POST {{baseUrl}}/change_baggage
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_ref": "ABC123", "p_baggage_count": 2 }

### 7. Quote (price breakdown)
POST {{baseUrl}}/quote_booking
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_ref": "ABC123" }

### 8. Confirm
POST {{baseUrl}}/confirm_booking
apikey: {{apikey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apikey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "p_ref": "ABC123" }
